{"id": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN", "offset": 3297, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 3128, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN", "offset": 3302, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f484f19cf948f14bf7d12f2ff167f0a7f158f14e81b8", "baseline_text": "힘내야 해…//키쿠노조∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "がんばるのよ……//菊之丞！", "pointer_offset": 3132, "unit": "dialogue:994e9380537d9527", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN", "offset": 3970, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f8b2f0bcf0d7f0b9f147f15781432f2ff8dff64cf1442f2ff1acf25af8aaf64cf26bf0eff0b58144", "baseline_text": "이 시합에서는，//제 패가//보너스 패예요오．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合では、//わたしのパイが//ボーナスパイになっていますぅ。", "pointer_offset": 3136, "unit": "dialogue:d1fb00084c043cb4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN", "offset": 3392, "capacity": 66, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff957f0b2f299f0b2f3b6f0b8f0cf816081442f2ff8b2f140f0b9f1478143f15af8bdf9a9f1d5f0d2f0e7f7d12f2ff1e1fbc1f1e2f1d5f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "이번 주제는 이것이랍니다～．//이 중에서，어느 한 세트를…//맞춰 주세요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題はこちらですよぉ。//この中の、どれか１組を……//そろえてくださいね。", "pointer_offset": 3140, "unit": "dialogue:b75c0578114193de", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN", "offset": 4021, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f55ef0aff3d081b82f2ff0dff944f5f3f0c7f0a8f0b881432f2ff293f294f0c7f1c9f0eff0b581b8", "baseline_text": "꺄아앙∈//제가 딜러라니，//부끄러워요오∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いや～ん！//わたしが親だなんて、//はずかしぃですぅ∈", "pointer_offset": 3144, "unit": "dialogue:0055e5e5dd9b02b6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN", "offset": 4062, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f944f5f3f0c7f7d12f2ff362f2a2f0f1f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨가 딜러…//맡길게요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さんが親……//おまかせしますね。", "pointer_offset": 3148, "unit": "dialogue:55703491a94bc296", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN", "offset": 3561, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f253f7d1f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f0e72f2ff0b2f3bbf0f0f0eff7d12f2ff7d1f14ff4ddf0ef8144", "baseline_text": "저…오오가미 씨를//이겼네요…//…기뻐요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わたし……大神さんに//勝てたんですね……//……うれしいです。", "pointer_offset": 3152, "unit": "dialogue:8139be080913e3d6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN", "offset": 3622, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0af8143f253f14ff7d12f2ff18ef2638143f46ef291f15af0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "아，저기…//정말，멋졌어요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あ、あの……//本当に、素敵でした……", "pointer_offset": 3156, "unit": "dialogue:0d9e158aa6c9a280", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN", "offset": 3659, "capacity": 62, "raw_hex": "f8b2f16bfa89f1adf181f0d3f144f0eff7d12f2ff1adf0aef7d1f0a6f282f8e1f0d3f181f0a2f0a32f2ff0b2f15af9d0f154f957fa99f16ff0aff0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "이 무슨 우연인가요…//우리…사랑의 인연으로//이어져 있는 것 같아요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "なんて偶然……//わたしたち……愛の絆で//結ばれているようですね！", "pointer_offset": 3160, "unit": "dialogue:915d1e469040f0d3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT23KIKU.SBN", "offset": 3724, "capacity": 19, "raw_hex": "5f6a6f625f637572736f725f616e696d617465", "baseline_text": "_job_cursor_animate", "kind": "ascr", "source": "_job_cursor_animate", "pointer_offset": 3164, "unit": "dialogue:0dd10e8d7b60ab63", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
